<!-- Custom Cup 2: a cup of 4 to 16 tracks of your choice, offline. R1 "Personalizada" on the
     cup menu opens the track menu to choose them; on the single race track menu R1 "Personalizada"
     turns the choosing on. While choosing, Cross adds the track ("Pista n de N", its picture in a
     grid of thumbnails; Circle takes the last one out), and with Copas Extendidas L1 / R1
     ("Cantidad") set N; the last one starts the cup as the cup menu does (its race settings, then
     its races and standings, "Circuito n / N"). Circle goes back to the menu it was started from.
     Winning it marks no cup's stars. -->
